 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey! How's everything going?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm starting a game everyone says is hard. Should I play on normal, or the easy mode?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.28,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Totally your call. What do you enjoy more, the challenge or the story?",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.21,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Honestly, both. But I'm a perfectionist, so I hate dying.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.9,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then maybe start on normal, and give yourself permission to switch down if it stops being fun. Most games let you change difficulty anytime.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Won't that feel like",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I failed?",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 2.21,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It really shouldn't. The developers added easy mode so more people can enjoy the game. There's no prize for suffering.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay. Normal, with an escape hatch.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.76,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. And if a boss takes you more than an hour, a short break often helps more than anything.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg27"
  }
 ]
}
